<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Store a follower inventory on a placeable.
</p><p>NOTE: As with all commands that add items to a container, this command will reset the container (placeable) to interactive no matter its previous state.
</p><p><br />
